WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.911
If you want to check what RosterEase keeps,
open Settings, then Privacy.

00:00:05.861 --> 00:00:07.059
Tap How Your Records Work.

00:00:08.309 --> 00:00:12.014
Your notes and visits stay on this phone
unless you share them through another
feature.

00:00:12.864 --> 00:00:14.908
Editing a saved note keeps the earlier
version.

00:00:16.108 --> 00:00:17.758
A check-in records the device's time.

00:00:18.608 --> 00:00:22.722
It doesn't independently prove attendance,
and a signature doesn't verify someone's
identity.

00:00:23.972 --> 00:00:27.049
Backups are encrypted, so keep your backup
key somewhere safe.

00:00:27.999 --> 00:00:31.921
For the detail on photos, recordings and
signatures, use the written guide below.
